issue.body:
unwrap the code form the macro($()、$$())
* fix #6312
* keep the ideally behavior with the [RFC#369](https://github.com/vuejs/rfcs/discussions/369) to avoid the unless extra bracket wrapping

code: 
```ts
const r = $ref(1)
$$(r)
```
now:

```ts
const r = _ref(1)
(r)

// ⬇️ formatted to
const r = _ref(1)(r);
// ❌ cannot access 'r' before initialization

```
RFC & after fix:
```ts
const r = _ref(1)
r

// ⬇️ formatted to
const r = _ref(1);
r;

```
